      "llm_summary": "Confirm the missing column in the selected task log and same dbt invocation. Compare the named table with its baseline as current corroboration, not a historical snapshot. A developer confirms producer contract and business meaning, aligns mapping or dependent model references, preserves originals and records the decision. Retry alone is insufficient. Verify a separate new run, all tasks, not_null and unique, counts and aggregates. Exclude connection-only or null-only failures."
